Galaxy S25 Ultra, SM8750 / Snapdragon 8 Elite, Android 16, arm64, bionic,
4 KB pages, 11 GB. Written up in out/DEVICE_ADDENDUM.md.

- **S15_android_device** — MeTTa (hyperon, fuel-metered via RunnerState) runs on
